\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, my Saviour, Brother, Friend
\par On whom  I cast my every care,
\par On whom for all things I depend,\tab 
\par Inspire, and then accept, my prayer.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. If I have tasted of Thy grace,
\par The grace that sure salvation brings:
\par If with me now Thy Spirit stays,
\par And hovering hides me in His wings:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Still let Him with my weakness stay,
\par Nor for a moments space depart,
\par Evil and danger turn away,
\par And keep till He renews my heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. When to the right or left I stray,
\par His voice behind me may I hear:
\par Return, and walk in Christ Thy way;
\par Fly back to Christ, for sin is near.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. His sacred unction from above
\par Be still my comforter and Guide:
\par Till all the hardness He remove,
\par And in my loving heart  reside.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Jesus, I fain would walk in Thee,
\par From natures every path retreat;
\par Thou art my way, my leader be,
\par And set upon the rock my feet.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Uphold me , Saviour, or I fall,
\par O reach me out Thy gracious hand!
\par Only on Thee for help I call,
\par Only by faith in Thee I stand.
\par                                Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2 
\par }

